# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Estimate / contact form delivery (Web3Forms).
#
# Create the key at https://web3forms.com for gilbertandsons2010@gmail.com,
# then click the activation link sent to that inbox. Submissions are delivered
# to whichever address the key was created for.
#
# The NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix is required so the browser can read it: Web3Forms
# blocks server-to-server calls on the free plan, so the form posts directly
# to their API. Web3Forms documents this key as safe to expose publicly.
#
# Local development: copy this file to .env.local and fill in the key.
# Production: set the same variable in Netlify → Environment variables,
# then redeploy (NEXT_PUBLIC_ values are baked in at build time).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
